Source: https://github.com/z-ai/zcode
Relevant source portions: packages/ui/src/v4/ConversationTurnGroup.tsx
(work header and consecutive tool summaries), conversationAssistantWorkItems.ts
(summary category/statistics and lexical path normalization), and
packages/ui/src/styles.css (light/dark neutral message surface values).

Modified for NestCraft, 2026-11-25:
- Adapted to this project's original React message DOM and native details.
- Preserved existing call/result pairing, arrival order and full raw details.
- Added explicit tool identity mapping, distinct-call counts and result-only labels.
- Kept unknown tool categories and lifecycle states unknown, with failure hints.
- Restricted file counting to explicit input paths, using lexical normalization.
- Used responsive 16px reading / 14px summaries in the sidebar, and 18px reading
  / 16px summaries in wide message containers, to match user screenshot scale.
- Scoped all appearance changes to the message scroller and existing scroll owner.

The upstream NOTICE.md contains broader application behavior descriptions and
unrelated third-party declarations; those components and behaviors were not
copied. This notice retains attribution relevant to the presentation adaptation.
